## 📋 Summary

| Issue | Severity | Recommendation |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Secrets in plain text `.env` file | 🔴 High | Use secrets manager (AWS SM, Vault, etc.) |
| Password in database URL | 🔴 High | Use separate credential fields or IAM auth |
| AWS keys in config | 🔴 High | Use IAM roles instead |
| No `.gitignore` for `.env` files | 🟠 Medium | Add `.env*` to `.gitignore` |
| No config validation | 🟠 Medium | Validate required vars at startup |
| No secrets rotation | 🟠 Medium | Use secrets manager with rotation |

